hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27920","Affan narrated to us, he said: Abu Awanah narrated to us, he said: al-Hurr ibn al-Sayyah narrated to us, from Hunaydah ibn Khalid, from his wife, from one of the wives of the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, she said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, used to fast nine days of Dhu al-Hijjah, and the day of Ashura, and three days of every month: the first Monday of the month, and two Thursdays."
